                                                "sense_id": "3890e312-f507-3fe9-a692-5e130fc36a52",
                                                "text": "A thin red stream poured down one of the rises, snaking its way around trees; a river turned red with bauxite?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e6cece48-2665-4997-a490-ecaf20e35af1",
